#: includes/admin/views/dashboard.php:136
msgid ""
"Free technical pre-check against the machine-verifiable PDF/UA-1 checkpoints — runs in your browser, no file leaves "
"your site."
msgstr ""
"Brezplačen predhodni tehnični pregled v skladu s standardom PDF/UA-1, ki ga je mogoče preveriti avtomatsko – poteka v "
"vašem brskalniku, nobena datoteka ne zapusti vaše spletne strani."

